rooms_desc ({"This entrance hall is very strange it hasonly three major features apart from the romantic lightingA huge King sized bed with silk sheets in the middle of the roomA large steaming shower in the corner.And a Massive refrigerator against the wallYou feel very Comfortable in this roomSo comfortable you feel like getting undressed","This is a huge room right in the centre of Adrians house,There is a gentle smell of honeysuckle drifting in from outsideThe whole room has soft romantic delicate candlelight which soothes your soulYou can hear Sarah McLauchlan playing softly on the Juke Box in the cornerThere is a huge open log fire burning in thelarge fireplace in the centre of the north wall.There is a thick soft deep rug on the floor in front of the fire,Behind the rug are a large comfortable couch and an old but very comfortable looking arm chair and rocking chairIn the corner of the room is situated a very well stocked drinks bar.Next to the bar is a pool table all set up and ready for use.Around the edge of the room are enough comfortable chairs to seatall of Adrians friends when he throws one of his wild parties.This room looks smells and feels like home..","This is by far the biggest room in the whole house.The major aspect of the room is the huge Olympic sizes swimming anddiving pools right in the centre of this warm well lit room.the smell and feel of the cool clean water is very refreshing to your skinin the far corner of the room there is a changing room the changing room has lots of lockers showers and clean towelsin the oposite corner of the room is an audio visual unit which hasa huge sterio system playing and showing MTV and Adrians favourite videosIn front of this is a very large hot bubbling spa bathAdrian likes to share this spa with his best female friends...Next to the spa is a coke machine and a coffee machine and well as a freezerThe freezer is stocked with Adrians favourite ice creams, sorbets and frozen YofoodsDon't worry if you have forgotten your swimming costume becauseAdrian won't mind if you want to skinny dip in his pool.He just wants all his friends to have lots of fun.","This room has everything you could possibly need to create any cullinarymasterpieces from around the world, and the whole room is filled withthe most wonderful smells of delicious foods that you could imagian.Just being in this room makes you feel oh so very hungary.There are lots of worktops and tables in the room coveredfwith food processors knifes, chopping boards, oven cloths, and utensils.I the corner of the room is a radio, tuned in to Virgin radio FMThere are huge ovens, hobs, mircowaves, fridges and freezers dotted aroundand on the back wall is the biggest wine rack you have ever seen,It holds every red and white wine of ever vintage you could imagian, there are even a few classy rose wines there for a little varietyand of course there are bottle and bottles of the finest champagnesIn the centre of the room is a huge dining table surrounded by at least20 solid but comfortable looking oak chairs, take a seat, let Adrianfulfill your fantasies and tantalize your tastebuds because he wouldjust love to cook for you.The most impostant thing lies in the corner, the dishwasher, Adrian is good at astove but always makes so much mess.","The room is large and filled with the wonderful scent of exotic flowersThe room is built in the shape of a huge glass dome.The temperature of the room is carefully controlled by electronicsIts just the right temperature to sit and relax and get a UV safe tanAt night this room is used as a place for Adrian to sit under the starsThis is a place to be creative... to write and play musicThere are all the finest instruments you could want lying around the roomThere is a telescope and lots of astrology maps tooOn the north wall is the biggest book case you could ever wantThe book case hold thousands of books including all of the classicsAdrians pride and joy is the original Romeo and Julliet manuscript...This room is also home to Adrians music loving animals.Adrians parrot is reciting Shakespear in the corner...Adrians dog Debussy is mellowing out in his basket on the east sideOutside the dome you can see all the wonderfull plants and wildlifeInside the dome are all of you favourite plants and animals and booksTake a seat and read or write some poetry.","This room is very peaceful white and pureThe decor in the room is almost regal in its beautyThe room is mainly decorated in white marble and gold.Dotted around the room are the most beautiful sculptures you have ever seenIn the centre of the room is a stone table...Stood on the table is a gold candle stick and a very old book.The book is infact a photo album and scrap book of the life of AdrianIf you have influenced his life you will find a section on you...If there isn't a section on you don't worry there is still time to write oneYou notice that hanging on the walls are some original Monet paintings.The paintings give this very simple and elegant room life and love.Maybe if you search hard enough you will find Adrians Heart in this room.But please remember to be careful and quiet as there is silent magic hereMaybe you should never leave the safety of this room.","This room is dimly lit by lava lamps and a plasma ball.The floor, walls and ceiling are all washable and paddedThe room is unnoticably coloured and soothing to the eyesThere is an unlimited supply of water, pepsi and munchies in the centre of the oom, feel free to take what ever you fancy there is always plenty more.Pick yourself some munchies and a bean bag and just flop in a corner.There is soothing but not to loud music playing constantly.Don't worry about falling over because you can't hurt yourself hereAlso you can not break ot steal any furnishings in this room.The roof of the room has tinted glass which blocks out the sun in the day but allows you to see the moon and stars at night.There are toilets behind both the west and east walls...Once you have gained your sences again for the night before maybeit will then be safe to venture outside once moreOr there again maybe you should just sleep some more...","This room is large and full of all the fun things to do in lifeThe major features are the full sized snooker and pool tables.There are also lots of card tables and roulette wheels for the gambelers.There is also another large well stocked bar in this room.THis bar seems more for the production of fine cocktails and snacksYou feels like rolling the dice in this room and chancing your luckYou never know you might just get lucky and hit the jackpotYou could just pull up a chair and try a hand of strip poker.If you are not into games just grab yourself a drink and join in the conversationthe important thing in this room is to have fun...If you can't have fun then find yourself another room.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
rooms_short ({"This is the Entrance to Splurge's house","This is Adrian's living room it is one of his favourite places on the MUD","This is Adrian's swimming pool, its the best pool you have ever seen.","This is Adrian's Kitchen, also the secon biggest room in the house.","This is a beautiful rose covered Passage connecting Adrians houses","This is the second half of Adrians house.. this is an Entrance Hall","This is the room where Adrian comes when he is drunk or hungover","This is Adrians games room.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",})
